WEBVTT

00:06:28.758 --> 00:06:30.805
we're giving directions to millions.

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:34.114
And that stranger may be
the occasional tourist,

00:06:35.098 --> 00:06:36.649
a researcher,

00:06:36.673 --> 00:06:38.446
a first responder,

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:41.384
a rescue worker working
in unfamiliar terrain.

00:06:42.693 --> 00:06:46.671
As we begin to think about
how to bridge the digital divide,

00:06:46.695 --> 00:06:48.909
we should go beyond
the traditional narrative

00:06:48.933 --> 00:06:52.299
of data extraction and consumption

00:06:52.323 --> 00:06:55.522
and think more critically
about the role you and I play

00:06:55.546 --> 00:06:59.411
in the creation of the technologies
and tools we use every day.